<p>647a_9cf6</p> For chromosome 14p, which band lies most proximal (closest to the centromere)?
PROMPT_647A_9CF6
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_1';
<span style='font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold;'>14p38.3</span>
LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_2';
<span style='font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold;'>14p27.1</span>
LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_3';
<span style='font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold;'>14p38.2</span>
LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_4';
<span style='font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold;'>14p34.2</span>
LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_5';
<span style='font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold;'>14p12.2</span>
LITERAL_647A_9CF6_CHOICE_5
